CERN Open Hardware Licence Version 2 - Weakly Reciprocal (CERN-OHL-W)

This project is licensed under the CERN Open Hardware Licence v2 — Weakly Reciprocal (CERN-OHL-W).

It is legally mandated that any expansion, distribution, or manufacturing of this architecture remains open, free, and accessible to all of humanity, protecting digital freedom from monopolization.

